### Get all categories
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/categories

### Get topics by category
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/topics/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get posts by topic
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/posts/{{topicId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get single post with comments
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/post/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new post (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My first post",
  "content": "This is the content of my post",
  "topicId": "{{topicId}}"
}

### Create a comment (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/comment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "This is a comment",
  "postId": "{{postId}}"
}

### Create a reply to a comment (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/comment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "This is a reply to a comment",
  "postId": "{{postId}}",
  "parentId": "{{commentId}}"
}

### Update a comment (requires authentication)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/comment/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Updated comment content"
}

### Delete a comment (requires authentication)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum/comment/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
